msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipChildFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relationshipChild is functional"
msgstr "relationshipChild 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipChildFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relationshipChild is functional: a reified parent-child relationship names exactly one child, the single younger party of the dyadic relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relationshipChild 是函数性的:一个具体化的亲子关系恰好指向一个子女——该二元关系项中唯一的年轻一方。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipParentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relationshipParent is functional"
msgstr "relationshipParent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipParentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relationshipParent is functional: a reified parent-child relationship names exactly one parent, so a child's two parents are two ParentChildRelationship relators rather than one relator carrying two parents."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relationshipParent 是函数性的:一个具体化的亲子关系恰好指向一个父母,因此一个孩子的两个父母是两个 ParentChildRelationship 关系项,而不是一个承载两个父母的关系项。"

